{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_21171.jpg","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"nameNarration":"Kagome","narration":"I have an urgent request to everyone.@A little while ago my friend Aru-chan@went missing.","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21171.jpg","narrationEffect":"in","narrationHAlignment":"left","narrationPosX":180.0,"turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"narration":"Something is strange about her,@and it may be possible that@a Witch is manipulating her."},{"narration":"If you see her, I would be happy@if you could capture her."},{"narration":"However, I received word that@she is acting dangerously,@so please be careful when catching her...!"},{"narration":"I am really sorry about this,@but please provide help...!"},{"autoTurnLast":1.0,"bg":"bg_adv_21023.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"nameNarration":"","narration":"[se:7106_telmail]*Ring♪*","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21023.jpg","narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":0}],"nameCenter":"Hinano","narrationEffect":"out","textCenter":"...A message from Kagome, huh."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameCenter":"Hinano","textCenter":"...Except..."},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"id":300301,"pos":0}],"textClear":1},{"bgm":"bgm03_story16","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":820400,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Aru-chan","textRight":"＜…………＞"},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"You're a little late contacting me at this point!"},{"chara":[{"id":820400,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Aru-chan","textRight":"＜××××！＞"},{"autoTurnLast":0.5,"chara":[{"effect":"slideOutRightFast","id":820400}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"Oh, come on! You're not gonna let me@catch you at all!?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300